solution platform which offers various software applications using one fully integrated system designed to streamline the flow of information to the primary functional areas of community hospitals. In addition, it offers acute care support and maintenance services comprising total system support, national client conference, continuing education, software releases, hardware replacement, cloud electronic health record, forms and supplies, instantPHR, and CHBase. Further, the company provides business management services; acute care EHR solutions and related services for community hospitals, and their physician clinics; and patient engagement and technology solutions. The company was formerly known as Computer Programs and Systems, Inc. and changed its name to TruBridge, Inc. in March 2024. TruBridge, Inc. was founded in 1979 and is headquartered in Mobile, Alabama."}}